## 👥 Incident Response Team (IRT)

| Role | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| **Incident Commander** | Owns the response, makes the calls, runs the timeline |
| **AI/Model Owner** | Technical containment, root cause, fix |
| **AI Governance Lead** | Severity, rights/harm assessment, regulatory trigger call |
| **Security** | If security-driven (injection, exfiltration, poisoning) |
| **Legal / DPO** | Regulatory reporting decisions, liability, notifications |
| **Comms** | Internal, executive, external, and regulator messaging |
| **Executive Sponsor** | SEV-1 authority (halt product, public statement) |

