## 📣 Communication Templates

**Internal alert (SEV declared)**
> `[SEV-{n}] AI Incident — {system}`. Detected {time}. Impact: {who/what}. Status: {contained?}. IC: {name}. Next update: {time}. Do not discuss externally.

**Executive brief**
> What happened, who's affected, is harm ongoing, containment status, regulatory exposure, decision(s) needed from you, next update time. One page, no jargon.

**Affected-user notice**
> Plain language: what happened, how it affected you, what we've done, what you should do, how to get help/redress. No blame-shifting, no minimizing.

**Regulator notification (skeleton)**
> Nature of the incident, AI system and purpose, individuals/rights affected, timeline, measures taken, contact point. File within the required window (below).

