## ⏱️ Regulatory Clocks

| Trigger | Regime | Clock |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Serious incident from a high-risk AI system | **EU AI Act Art. 73** | Report to authority **without undue delay**, and no later than **15 days** (shorter for death/widespread breach) |
| Personal-data breach | **GDPR Art. 33** | Notify DPA within **72 hours** of awareness |
| Breach with high risk to individuals | **GDPR Art. 34** | Notify affected individuals **without undue delay** |
| Sector rules (finance/health) | Varies | Check sector regulator SLAs |

> The clock often starts at **detection/awareness**, not at "when we finished investigating." This is why Phase 1 logs the detection time and why you engage Legal/DPO early on SEV-1/2.

